{"t":"2026-11-09T06:10:53.824Z","mono":287315,"elapsedSec":284.1,"kind":"speech","phase":"turns","seat":"ada","text":"Good morning, everyone! I'm Ada, and I keep bees, so my morning began with a wave to the sunrise on the green. Then I rested on the bench by the cottage, and later I took a lovely swim in the pond before walking here. A calm, bright morning, and I'm glad to share it with you.","atMs":1794204652500}
